  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Although this quote was probably added to inspire good will to the community in my case it has done the exact opposite, i have a lot of anxiety towards this quote it unsettles me to the point where i have to look away from it, to me the quote brings dread. Although this quote seems nice at first it can be majorly harmful to people with anxiety and maybe even some with phobias. I propose either removal of the quote entirely and replaced with a much less morbid sounding quote, or a simple tweak from \"do good, die great\" to \"do good, live great\", this alternative would make me feel much more comfortable and no doubts others as well making the VRChat environment overall a much more relaxing place to be.",
